{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# mattpocock/skills\n\n> Skills for Real Engineers\n> github.com/mattpocock/skills\n\n**22 個 active skills** | Engineering 17 + Productivity 5\n作者：Matt Pocock（Total TypeScript）","x":-200,"y":-450,"width":500,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"philosophy","type":"text","text":"## 設計哲學\n\n1. **小而可組合** — 每個 skill 做一件事\n2. **模型無關** — Claude Code / Codex / Pi 通用\n3. **強調基礎** — TDD、review、領域建模、架構\n4. **人保留控制** — 不強制接管流程","x":-200,"y":-310,"width":500,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## 圖例\n\n🟢 **綠色** = ✅ 已安裝\n⚪ **灰色** = 未安裝\n\n**User** = 使用者手動呼叫 `/skill`\n**Model** = agent 可自動選用\n\nUser-invoked 負責**編排流程**\nModel-invoked 持有**可重用紀律**\n\n---\n已安裝 7 / 22","x":400,"y":-450,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cat-eng-user","type":"text","text":"## 🔧 Engineering — User-invoked","x":-650,"y":-50,"width":280,"height":115,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cat-eng-model","type":"text","text":"## 🔧 Engineering — Model-invoked","x":-650,"y":530,"width":280,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cat-prod-user","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 Productivity — User-invoked","x":340,"y":-120,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cat-prod-model","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 Productivity — Model-invoked","x":340,"y":430,"width":280,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cat-inprogress","type":"text","text":"## 🚧 In-progress（不建議安裝）","x":340,"y":600,"width":280,"height":50,"color":"7"},
		{"id":"cat-misc","type":"text","text":"## 🛠 Misc / Personal","x":-650,"y":750,"width":280,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-setup","type":"text","text":"### ✅ setup-matt-pocock-skills\n\n初始化設定\nissue tracker / labels\n**每個 repo 跑一次**","x":-950,"y":20,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-grill-me","type":"text","text":"### ✅ grill-me\n\n深度追問\n把需求問清楚再動手","x":-950,"y":130,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-to-spec","type":"text","text":"### ✅ to-spec\n\n對話 → 規格書\n自動發到 issue tracker","x":-950,"y":240,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-to-tickets","type":"text","text":"### ✅ to-tickets\n\nSpec → Tracer-bullet tickets\n每張標明 blocking edges","x":-950,"y":350,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-implement","type":"text","text":"### implement\n\n依照 spec/tickets 實作\n驅動 TDD + code review","x":-950,"y":460,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-wayfinder","type":"text","text":"### wayfinder\n\n規劃大型工作\n跨多 session 的 investigation tickets","x":-950,"y":-80,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-improve-arch","type":"text","text":"### ✅ improve-codebase-architecture\n\n掃描 codebase 架構\n產生 HTML 報告","x":-650,"y":130,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-tdd","type":"text","text":"### ✅ tdd\n\n紅-綠-重構 TDD 循環\n一次一個 vertical slice","x":-950,"y":580,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-code-review","type":"text","text":"### ✅ code-review\n\n雙軸 review\nStandards + Spec 並行","x":-950,"y":690,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skill-diagnosing","type":"text","text":"### diagnosing-bugs\n\n紀律化 bug 診斷\nreproduce → minimise → fix","x":-950,"y":800,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-prototype","type":"text","text":"### prototype\n\n建 throwaway prototype\n驗證設計問題","x":-650,"y":620,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-research","type":"text","text":"### research\n\n深度調查\n產出引用式 Markdown","x":-650,"y":730,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-domain","type":"text","text":"### domain-modeling\n\n建立專案領域模型\n挑戰術語 + 更新 CONTEXT.md","x":-650,"y":840,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-codebase-design","type":"text","text":"### codebase-design\n\n設計 deep modules\n大量行為藏在小介面後","x":-380,"y":620,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-merge","type":"text","text":"### resolving-merge-conflicts\n\n逐 hunk 解決 git conflict\n追溯 intent 到原始來源","x":-380,"y":730,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-grilling","type":"text","text":"### grilling\n\n追問的核心循環\n被 grill-me / grill-with-docs 呼叫","x":500,"y":470,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-handoff","type":"text","text":"### handoff\n\n對話 → 交接文件\n供另一個 agent 續作","x":500,"y":30,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"skill-teach","type":"text","text":"### teach\n\n多 session 教學\n用目錄當狀態化工作區","x":500,"y":140,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"skill-writing","type":"text","text":"### writing-great-skills\n\n如何寫好 skill\n參考指南","x":500,"y":250,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"flow","type":"text","text":"## 📋 典型工作流\n\n```\n/grill-me → 搞清楚需求\n    ↓\n/to-spec → 產出規格書\n    ↓\n/to-tickets → 拆成 tickets\n    ↓\n/implement → 逐個實作（自動觸發 /tdd + /code-review）\n    ↓\n/improve-codebase-architecture → 定期維護\n```","x":-200,"y":960,"width":500,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"skill-triage","type":"text","text":"### triage\n\nIssue 分流狀態機","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":230,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-ask-matt","type":"text","text":"### ask-matt\n\n路由器\n推薦該用哪個 skill","x":-350,"y":-140,"width":200,"height":80,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"skill-grill-with-docs","type":"text","text":"### grill-with-docs\n\n深度追問 + 領域建模\n自動建 CONTEXT.md + ADR","x":110,"y":15,"width":230,"height":170,"color":"6"}
	],
